  "question": "What\u2019s the nearest zoo you encounter en route to Lebanon Suites, Lebanon, KY from Kentucky Action Park, Cave City, KY?",
  "sql": "WITH\n    angle AS (SELECT degrees(ST_Azimuth(ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-86.0041 37.132939)',4326)::geography, ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-85.255941 37.568448)',4326)::geography)) AS value)\nSELECT * FROM pois,angle\nWHERE tourism = 'zoo'\nAND (degrees(ST_Azimuth(ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-86.0041 37.132939)',4326)::geography, pois.geometry)) BETWEEN angle.value - 22.5 AND angle.value + 22.5)\nORDER BY pois.geometry <-> ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-86.0041 37.132939)',4326)::geography ASC\nLIMIT 1;\n",
